WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.738
Good morning! Who are you?

2
00:00:10.739 --> 00:00:14.793
I'm an emperor penguin.

3
00:00:14.794 --> 00:00:20.002
We're the biggest penguins in the world.

4
00:00:20.003 --> 00:00:22.857
Where do you live?

5
00:00:22.858 --> 00:00:28.360
Emperor penguins live in Antarctica.

6
00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:32.886
We live on the cold ice.

7
00:00:32.887 --> 00:00:36.428
We stay near water.

8
00:00:36.429 --> 00:00:39.418
Do you fly?

9
00:00:39.419 --> 00:00:44.577
Penguins have feathers.

10
00:00:44.578 --> 00:00:48.878
But we don't fly.

11
00:00:48.879 --> 00:01:02.755
We just swim.

12
00:01:02.756 --> 00:01:06.526
You can dive too!

13
00:01:06.527 --> 00:01:11.714
Emperor penguins can dive very deep.

14
00:01:11.715 --> 00:01:15.183
We dive to find food.

15
00:01:15.184 --> 00:01:20.096
We eat fish and squid.

16
00:01:20.097 --> 00:01:23.919
Do you lay eggs?

17
00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:28.196
The mother penguin lays one egg.

18
00:01:28.197 --> 00:01:33.172
Then the father takes care of the egg.

19
00:01:33.173 --> 00:01:36.813
How does the father do that?

20
00:01:36.814 --> 00:01:41.359
He holds the egg on his feet.

21
00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:47.490
Then he doesn't eat or go anywhere.

22
00:01:47.491 --> 00:01:53.041
After two months the egg finally hatches.

23
00:01:53.042 --> 00:01:56.554
How do you stay warm?

24
00:01:56.555 --> 00:02:00.542
We live in big groups.

25
00:02:00.543 --> 00:02:07.672
We huddle together in the cold.

26
00:02:07.673 --> 00:02:13.539
We take turns standing in the warmest spots.

27
00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:23.869
I'm ready to dive again. Good-bye!

28
00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:31.004
See you later, Emperor Penguin!

